sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Browser access through the VM
  accDescr: A dedicated SSH local forward sends browser SOCKS requests into the existing guest proxy.
  participant B as Browser on Mac
  participant L as Mac 127.0.0.1:1080
  participant G as VM 127.0.0.1:18082
  participant R as Selected route
  Note over L,G: zbox socks opens a dedicated SSH -L tunnel
  B->>L: SOCKS5 CONNECT with hostname
  L->>G: Forward unchanged SOCKS bytes over SSH
  Note over G: Fetch current host routing policy
  alt Hostname matches network list
    G->>R: Mac SOCKS via reverse SSH, Mac resolves name
  else Guest localhost / guest service
    G->>R: Connect inside VM
  else Other external destination
    G->>R: VM egress: VLESS, trusted LAN, or Lima
  end
  R-->>G: TCP stream
  G-->>L: SSH stream
  L-->>B: Website data
  Note over B,G: Use proxy DNS, disable browser loopback bypass for guest localhost
  Note over L,G: Ctrl+C closes this tunnel, VM and agent sessions stay running
